Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(integration): local HTTP MCP bridge + 9 new board
 tools + porting assets

- mcp_server: add kHttpRpcIdBase + SetResultSink so device tool results can be
  returned synchronously to a local caller without touching the cloud wss path.
- notify_http_server: add GET /tools, POST /mcp (generic JSON-RPC relay), and
  GET/POST /config for NVS websocket.url/token/version + wifi.ota_url. This
  removes the need to recompile when switching between xiaozhi cloud and a
  self-hosted MCP gateway.
- board: register MCP tools regardless of PY32 probe result (previously all
  10 tools vanished when PY32 was missing); guard servo tools with servo_ok_.
- board: new tools self.led.set_many / clear / pattern (rainbow/breath/chase),
  self.face.list / overlay, self.head.get_angles / tilt,
  self.gateway_config.get / set.
- porting: stage MIT feetech_scs driver, mDNS discovery, listening_profile,
  Si12T touch gesture state machine and power-save gate from stackchan-mcp.

NOT COMPILED: no ESP-IDF / Docker toolchain on this machine.
